# CR 115.1d, ADR-0041: Deny the Witch counters target activated ability, then
# "its controller loses life equal to the number of creatures you control"
# (DB$ LoseLife | Defined$ TargetedController). The countered ability has left
# the stack by then; Java still holds the SpellAbility object and reads its
# activating player (AbilityUtils.java:956-962), which the engine keeps as the
# ability's last-seen record (Ability.stackTargets). human pings ai with
# Prodigal Pyromancer (stack item 1); ai's Deny the Witch counters it, and
# human loses 2 life for ai's two Grizzly Bears.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 W
tapformana ai 4 U
tapformana ai 5 B
tapformana ai 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue targets ai
queue targets stack:1
queue action human activate 1 0
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
